Package: Precious.metals
Title: Forecast Precious Metals Prices with ARIMA
Version: 1.3.0
Authors@R: person("Enrique", "Pérez Herrero",
                  email = "eph.project1500@gmail.com",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Enrique Pérez Herrero [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Enrique Pérez Herrero <eph.project1500@gmail.com>
Description: A Shiny application that downloads the last three years of gold,
    silver, palladium, and platinum futures prices from Yahoo Finance and
    forecasts the next 90 trading days using the auto.arima() function from the forecast package.
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
License: file LICENSE
LazyData: true
